  order: 2
  title: Aggressive inmate
  difficulty: 1
  briefing: An inmate has been kicking his cell door and shouting threats at staff
    for ten minutes. You are sent to deal with him and have to open his cell. Expect
    him to come straight at you.
  task: 'Give clear commands and a warning before using force. If he attacks, respond
    in proportion, then bring him under control: have him face the wall.'
  forceRules: Words first. Use force only against active resistance and no more than
    needed. Warn before force when you can. Every use of force is recorded.
  objective: Bring the aggressive inmate under control
